<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The <code>sResource</code> and <code>nTrapType</code> members are a column name and a row number for a look-up (using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetM2DAResource" title="GetM2DAResource">GetM2DAResource</a> function) as a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Resource%20keyword" title="Resource keyword">resource</a> is an invalid type for a struct.
</p>
